    "status": "SUCCEEDED",
    "answer": "按《Chinook 业务指标口径手册 项目自编》的定义：本项目将客单价主口径写全为平均每张发票金额，表达式 AVG(invoice.total)，每张发票权重相同。 [E1]\n\n查询结果：6.0942857142857143。",
    "rewritten_question": null,
    "sql": "SELECT AVG(invoice.total) AS average_invoice_amount FROM public.invoice JOIN public.customer ON invoice.customer_id = customer.customer_id WHERE customer.country = 'USA' AND invoice.invoice_date >= CAST('2024-01-01' AS DATE) AND invoice.invoice_date < CAST('2025-01-01' AS DATE)",
